Significantly enjoyed this game; considering buying it after the free trial.
Pros:
- Logical, linear game flow;
- Well-designed mission objectives (almost entirely bug-free);
- Excellent graphics - really gives the feel of being a computerised tabletop;
Cons:
- Unit management is painful, although understandably so;
- Sometimes, NPCs' actions lead one to wish to bang their thick skulls together.
Overall, a nice, solid game. Would recommend.

Beatifull graphics;
Smooth gameplay;
Very decent AI;
Epic battles with tons of enemies;
Play several stormtroppers classes with a great variaty of weapons, tools, jetpacks, etc;
Play jedi heroes and use force powers (occasionally);
Drive any vehicle you ever desire, from small to huge ones.
Fight space battles, land inside huge battleships and blow up them;
Fight at amazing alien battlefields, with dangerous monsters;
A very fun campaign, full of action;
No troubles on newest computers/OS (I'm running win 10);
Some say the multiplayer still works. I did not try yet.
It has the SOUL of Star Wars universe with great game design. I love it.
If you are a fan you NEED it.

